{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春ですねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬が終わりました。。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ\nもう一回くらいはスキー行きたかった！\nしっとり温泉旅行もっ！\n雪の降る中で寒い中あったかいお湯に浸かりたいのだっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/21/6947373/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっちゃーん(＾ω＾)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nなんか生駒ちゃんのモバメ機械が調子悪いみたいで届いてないみたいです〜㌆㌆㌆㌆｡ﾟ(ﾟ´Д｀ﾟ)ﾟ｡㌆㌆㌆㌆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもちゃんと送ってるのにっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で届かないの〜〜〜㌆㌆㌆㌆｡ﾟ(ﾟ´Д｀ﾟ)ﾟ｡㌆㌆㌆㌆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！\n乃木坂と、まなぶのお渡し会でお会いしましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}